---
/**
 * The credit line for the main rank. One place to change when RANK_SOURCE
 * changes. `asOf` is the capture date (YYYY-MM-DD) when known.
 */
interface Props {
  asOf?: string | null;
  /** "Ranking" (one distro) or "Rankings" (lists). */
  noun?: string;
}
const { asOf = null, noun = "Rankings" } = Astro.props;
---

{noun} from our <a href="/about/#ranking">composite index</a>: English Wikipedia article views,
<a href="https://distrowatch.com/dwres.php?resource=popularity" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DistroWatch</a> page hits,
GitHub stars and views on this site{asOf ? `, built ${asOf}` : ""}. All of these measure interest, not installs.
